message: "If you use CadenceVAD in research, please cite this software."
title: "CadenceVAD"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Dutta"
    given-names: "Sayak"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-17
license: "MIT AND CC-BY-4.0"
abstract: >-
  A causal streaming voice-activity detector with a learnable modulation-domain
  filterbank, a single-protocol AVA-Speech evaluation harness, and a portable
  low-latency C runtime for Windows, Linux and macOS.
references:
